  "title": "Warm Smoky Spanish Semolina Paella",
  "description": "A traditional Spanish dish from Galicia, featuring semolina and smoky flavors, perfect for a midnight craving. This whole30 friendly recipe is a fermented, glassy jelly like paella.",
