  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan over medium high heat.",
    "Add the sliced chorizo and cook until browned, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until pink, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the semolina and stir to coat with oil and mix with garlic.",
    "Add the chicken broth, smoked paprika, and sea salt, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
